oes not have relevant callable capabilities for the task, say so briefly and continue with the best fallback.\n</plugins_instructions>"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019f6bb9-c066-7330-b52e-1d094ec3ce2a"}}}
